From 561df3d69cae7996281797c1ca1c5d5ba68e8c6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:59:55 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] system: translate the rom settings strings

The rom settings screen only shipped english and turkish text, so
every other locale fell back to english.

Add translations for the remaining locales the Play Integrity
strings already cover. Brand names and the sound pack arrays stay
untranslated.
